iption":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-03-29T13:08:56Z","updated_at":"2026-04-03T16:55:50Z","closed_at":"2026-04-03T16:55:42Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117964","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117964","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117964.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117964.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes #117852.\n\nWhen a `RigidBody3D` is frozen in kinematic mode, `_sync_body_state` is still called every physics frame. Previously, it unconditionally called `set_global_transform()`, which triggers `NOTIFICATION_TRANSFORM_CHANGED` on all children — even when the transform hasn't actually changed.\n\nThis adds a freeze-mode guard to skip the `set_global_transform()` call when the body is frozen in kinematic mode, matching the pattern already used in `RigidBody2D::_sync_body_state`.\n\n---\n\n**AI disclosure:** AI tooling (Claude Code) was used to assist with writing and reviewing the code. All modifications were reviewed and tested by the author.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repit